WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:04.030
Like everybody said, he provided
this essence of life,

2
00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:13.270
this almost sixth sense of knowing how to move,
how to do without.

3
00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:17.530
Yes, there was thinking,
but he went with the flow.

4
00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.450
And I so admire that about him.

5
00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:28.970
And being at the Rondo, of course, he gave me
my first job at like 10 years old.

6
00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:30.610
And it really wasn't much of a job.

7
00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:34.910
All I had to do was open a bottle of Coca-Cola,
classic glass bottle,

8
00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:37.250
pop the top, and he gave me 20 shekels.

9
00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:40.670
And I will never forget that,
because that was like, that was...

10
00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:43.050
I thought I had a million dollars
in my pocket.
